#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:11
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (MiddleClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Selects the action performed when middle-clicking on the main game area. If "
"a middle mouse button is not available, this action can be performed by "
"left- and right-clicking simultaneously or by left-clicking while holding "
"the control key."
msgstr ""
"Escolle a acción que se realiza ao premer co botón central do rato na área "
"principal do xogo. Se non dispón do botón central do rato, esta acción pode "
"facerse premendo á vez cos botóns esquerdo e dereito, ou só co esquerdo pero "
"mantendo á vez premida a tecla control."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:24
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (RightClickAction), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Selects the action performed when right-clicking on the main game area."
msgstr ""
"Escolle a acción a realizar cando se preme co botón dereito na área "
"principal do xogo."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:29
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AnimationSpeed), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:15
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Adjusts the speed with which the in game animations are displayed."
msgid "Adjusts the speed at which the in game animations are displayed."
msgstr "Axusta a velocidade coa que se mostran as animacións do xogo."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:35
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (AllowUnsafeMoves), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"If unchecked, the game will ignore any move (with the exception of random "
"teleports) that would result in the immediate death of the hero."
msgstr ""
"Se non sinala esta opción, a partida ignorará calquera movimento (excepto as "
"teleportacións aleatorias) que cause a morte imediata do heroi."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:42
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Ruleset), group (Rules)
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Selects the set of game rules to be used in the next game."
msgstr "Escolle as regras a utilizar na seguinte partida."

#. i18n: file: settings.kcfg:49
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Theme), group (Theme)
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Selects the theme used to display all in game elements."
msgstr "Escolle o tema utilizado para mostrar todos os elementos do xogo."

